{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve the execution-level combinator error contract**\n\n`getResult()` rethrows a plain `Error` containing only the message, so this test passes if the final error type regresses from `PromiseCombinatorError` to a generic error. The per-step assertions cover only the child errors. Restore the exact `execution.getError()` assertion, including `errorType`, while retaining the invocation-count tolerance.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs74585L","finding_digest":"0602ca001bdf246ac8f4e455917122781217648ed2686ddc8f7617f67d8e6076","finding_id":"arf_v1_aybmuaa334sgvshu4rkzc4jcpa","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-examples/src/examples/promise/any/promise-any.test.ts::failure-case::final-error-type-coverage","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-examples/src/examples/promise/any/promise-any.test.ts::failure-case::final-error-type-coverage","line":41,"observation_digest":"c8ada8ab6a6baf8054299ab2baa620c53e2ebe9b71081bde4d29a61a2b39f2e3","observation_id":"aro_v1_zcw2rk3knoxyavbjtkzlvjrayu","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-examples/src/examples/promise/any/promise-any.test.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_aybmuaa334sgvshu4rkzc4jcpa","published_at":"2026-10-04T03:08:34Z","review_id":"arr_v1_sl2ur4r235373dhaznbfdhnydx","reviewed_base_sha":"cc7db9bacb23278c58aecf16821737ba47797152","reviewed_head_sha":"6c776eba93f82a60ec9951cc0109d60a2a211dec","reviewer":"codex","start_line":41,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_wyt6zndp7vivqbkfrysal6xxjy"},"pull_request":{"number":959},"record_id":"art_v1_c6lfjizxomgv3ijudldfvjfthc","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-04T03:08:34Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
